11	/**
12	 * Public live-chat endpoint used by <ChatWidget/>.
13	 *
14	 * POST /api/chat  — start or continue a conversation for a visitorId.
15	 * GET  /api/chat?visitorId=…  — poll the visitor's open conversation.
16	 *
17	 * Everything is scoped strictly by the client-supplied `visitorId`; we never
18	 * return another visitor's data. Signed-in customers additionally get their
19	 * `userId` stamped on the conversation. Unauthenticated + write-heavy, so the
20	 * POST path is rate-limited per IP.
21	 */
